ned to the muscle territory, colored in pink [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B12">12</xref>]. <bold>(b)</bold> A diagram of a section through the anterior-posterior axis of a tailbud-stage embryo, showing the position of the larval tissues derived from the different territories in the fertilized egg. Colors are as in (a). <bold>(c)</bold> A young post-metamorphic adult.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="gb-2002-3-10-reviews1030-1"/></fig></sec></back></article>